function ChidoriShinsoCond takes nothing returns boolean
return GetSpellAbilityId()=='A12I' and GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetTriggerUnit(),'A40X')==0
endfunction
function ChidoriShinsoCast2 takes nothing returns nothing
local timer t=GetExpiredTimer()
local integer id=GetHandleId(t)
local unit u=LoadUnitHandle(h,id,0)
local real x=LoadReal(h,id,1)
local real y=LoadReal(h,id,2)
local real a=Atan2(LoadReal(h,id,4)-y,LoadReal(h,id,3)-x)
local real l__d=LoadReal(h,id,5)
local group g=LoadGroupHandle(h,id,6)
local real r=LoadReal(h,id,7)
local integer l__idg=GetHandleId(g)
local player p=GetOwningPlayer(u)
local real x1
local real y1
local integer l__ide
local real dmg=(2+GetUnitAbilityLevel(u,'A12I'))*GetHeroAgi(u,true)
if l__d<1550 then
set x1=x+l__d*Cos(a)
set y1=y+l__d*Sin(a)
call UnitAddAbility(u,'A12V')
call UnitRemoveAbility(u,'A12V')
call SaveReal(h,id,5,l__d+25)
call UnitApplyTimedLife(CreateUnit(p,'e0WD',x1,y1,a*bj_RADTODEG),'BTLF',0.6-l__d*0.00035)
call GroupEnumUnitsInRange(g,x1,y1,100,Base)
loop
set E=FirstOfGroup(g)
exitwhen E==null
set l__ide=GetHandleId(E)
if Condition_Base(p,E)and E!=LoadUnitHandle(h,l__idg,l__ide)then
call myCustomDamage(u,E,dmg,false,false,null,null,null)
call SetControlToUnit(E,E, 2, "stun")
call DestroyEffect(AddSpecialEffectTarget("war3mapImported\\BloodEX.mdx",E,"chest"))
call SaveUnitHandle(h,l__idg,l__ide,E)
endif
call GroupRemoveUnit(g,E)
endloop
else
call PauseUnit(u,false)
call UnitRemoveAbility(u,'A12M')
call DestroyTimer(t)
call DestroyGroup(g)
call FlushChildHashtable(h,id)
call FlushChildHashtable(h,l__idg)
endif
set p=null
set u=null
set g=null
set t=null
endfunction
function ChidoriShinsoCast takes nothing returns nothing
local unit u=GetTriggerUnit()
local timer t=CreateTimer()
local integer id=GetHandleId(t)
local real x=GetUnitX(u)
local real y=GetUnitY(u)
local real a=Atan2(GetSpellTargetY()-y,GetSpellTargetX()-x)
call SaveGroupHandle(h,id,6,CreateGroup())
call SaveReal(h,id,5,0)
call SaveUnitHandle(h,id,0,u)
set x=x+12*Cos(a+deg90)
set y=y+12*Sin(a+deg90)
call SaveReal(h,id,1,x+85*Cos(a))
call SaveReal(h,id,2,y+85*Sin(a))
call SaveReal(h,id,3,GetSpellTargetX())
call SaveReal(h,id,4,GetSpellTargetY())
call SaveReal(h,id,7,1)
call UnitAddAbility(u,'A12M')
call PauseUnit(u,true)
call SetUnitAnimation(u,"spell throw two")
set soundplay=SndN(2292) // Sound\Music\mp3Music\Chidori.mp3
call StartSound(soundplay)
//call KillSoundWhenDone(soundplay) // звук из массива soundStr — не удалять
call TimerStart(t,0.008,true,function ChidoriShinsoCast2)
set u=null
set t=null
endfunction
