call LANG_A('A02D',1,0,"\"Path of Hell\": Mukuro breaks the ground under the enemies' feet (3*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF). \"Path of the Animals\": Each enemy within a radius of 400 is grabbed and held for 4 seconds. snake (50 per sec.). \"Path of Demons\": Mukuro runs in the direction he is looking and attacks all oppone"+"nts (distance 750, damage (2*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF). \"Path of People\": HP regeneration, Mukuro's damage and defense increase (+10 ,+20%,+5 pts for 15 sec) Path of Paradise: Mukuro creates (2) copies of himself (copies deal 25% damage and take 100% damage for 15 sec).|n |n|cFF00A5FF|nCooldown"+": 20 seconds|r")
