call LANG_A('A02D',3,0,"\"Path of Hell\": Mukuro breaks the ground under the feet of enemies (3\\4\\5\\6\\7*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF). \"Path of the Animals\": Each enemy within a radius of 400 is grabbed and held for 4 seconds. snake (50\\75\\100\\125\\150 in sec.). \"Path of the Demons\": Mukuro runs in the direction "+"he is looking at and attacks all opponents (distance 750, damage (2\\3\\4\\5\\6*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF). \"Path of People\": HP regeneration, Mukuro's damage and defense increase (+10\\20\\30\\40\\50,+20%\\40%\\60%\\80%\\100%,+5\\7\\10\\13\\15 pts for 15 sec.)|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nCooldown: 20 second"+"s|r|r")
