call LANG_A('A02G',1,4,"\"Path of Hell\": Grabs the enemy with vines tree (175 per second for 6 seconds). \"Path of Animals\": Summons a large snake that attacks the enemy (25 sec.) \"Path of Demon\": Mukuro quickly approaches the enemy and attacks him (8*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF) \"Path of People\": Teleports the enemy"+" to himself and deals 6*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF damage. Path of Paradise: Mukuro creates (10) copies of the target enemy (Copies deal 25% damage and take 100% damage for 15 seconds)|n|n|cFF00A5FFCooldown: 25 seconds|r")
