call LANG_A('A02G',3,0,"\"Path of Hell\": Grabs the enemy with vines tree (75\\100\\125\\150\\175 per second for 6 seconds). \"Path of Animals\": Summons a large snake that attacks the enemy (5\\10\\15\\20\\25 sec.) \"Path of Demon\": Mukuro quickly approaches the enemy and attacks him (4\\5\\6\\7\\8*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF0"+"0A5FF) Path of the People: Teleports an enemy towards you and deals 2\\3\\4\\5\\6*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF damage.|nPath of Paradise: Mukuro creates (2\\4\\6\\8\\10) copies of the targeted enemy (Copies deal 25% damage and take 100% damage for 15 seconds)|n|n|cFF00A5FFCooldown: 25 seconds|r")
