call LANG_A('MrF1',1,0,"Moria creates a shadow that can use Q, W, E, R, can swap with Moria, and also receives copies of Moria's items.|n• The shadow always has Moria's current stats and MP, as well as a base 150% HP recovery efficiency, but Moria's MP recovery efficiency is weakened by (80-Hero Level)%.|n• Killing the"+" shadow applies 4 sec. doom and 4 sec. necrosis to Moria and deals unblockable true damage equal to 25% of Moria's Max HP + 300.|n• Items and abilities have a common cooldown and common MP costs, including ultimate defensive items.|n• Activating ultimate defensive items via ESC, as well as void "+"orbs, occurs for both. Stealing or breaking items deactivates the item for both.|n• Patriot and Akatsuki Set count Moria and Doppelman as one target.|n• The shadow deals 60% damage if it is further than 2500 from Moria. If the shadow is closer than 700, 30% of the damage Moria takes will be tran"+"sferred to Doppelman.|n• The ability can be canceled by pressing G on Doppelman.|n|n|cFF00A5FFCooldown: 10 sec. (40 sec. after death)|r|n|r")
call LANG_A('MrF2',1,0,"Swaps you and the shadow.|n|n|cFF00A5FFCooldown: 5 sec.|r")
call LANG_A('MrG1',1,0,"When used on an enemy, Moria attempts to steal the shadow of the target enemy.|nIf Moria is not controlled within 1.5 sec., he cuts off the enemy's shadow, stunning, putting to sleep, and reducing their stats until the end of the round.|n• During the theft, the target is drawn to Moria.|n• The s"+"hadow cannot be taken from the target again.|n• The shadow cannot return to the owner until the end of the round.|n• Swapping places with Doppelman, as well as the Space Sphere and the disappearance of the target from the map, cancels the theft.|n• From level 35, Moria gains invulnerability.|n"+"|nWhen used on an allied hero or on himself, the target receives the stolen enemy's shadow, receiving the stolen stats.|n• The shadow can be transferred from an ally to another hero or to yourself, or turned into a zombie.|n• Shadow selection is available using CTRL + G.|n|n|cFF00A5FFNumber of s"+"tats taken: 10% of enemy's white stats +3.|nControl: 2 sec. stun + 2 sec. sleep|nRange: 200|nCooldown: 7 sec.|r|n|r")
call LANG_A('MrG1',3,0,"When used on an enemy, Moria attempts to steal the shadow of the target enemy.|nIf Moria is not controlled within 1.5 sec., he cuts off the enemy's shadow, stunning, putting to sleep, and reducing their stats until the end of the round.|n• During the theft, the target is drawn to Moria.|n• The s"+"hadow cannot be taken from the target again.|n• The shadow cannot return to the owner until the end of the round.|n• Swapping places with Doppelman, as well as the Space Sphere and the disappearance of the target from the map, cancels the theft.|n• From level 35, Moria gains invulnerability.|n"+"|nWhen used on an allied hero or on himself, the target receives the stolen enemy's shadow, receiving the stolen stats.|n• The shadow can be transferred from an ally to another hero or to yourself, or turned into a zombie.|n• Shadow selection is available using CTRL + G.|n|n|cFF00A5FFNumber of s"+"tats taken: 10% of enemy's white stats +3.|nControl: 2 sec. stun + 2 sec. sleep|nRange: 200|nCooldown: 7 sec.|r|n|r")
call LANG_A('MrG2',1,0,"Cancel Doppelman.|n|n|cFF00A5FFCast time: +1 sec.|r")
call LANG_A('MrG2',3,0,"Cancel Doppelman.|n|n|cFF00A5FFCast time: +1 sec.|r")
