call LANG_A('MrQ1',1,0,"When used on a point, the hero disintegrates into shadow bats that fly in the specified direction, clinging to the first enemy hit, preventing them from casting spells or attacking.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 3*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF.|nDuration: 2 sec.|nRange: 1200|nAoE: 200|nCooldown: 20 sec.|r|n|"+"nWhen used on himself, the hero creates many bats that fly in different directions and prevents all affected enemies from attacking.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 60 + 1*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF.|nDuration: 2 sec.|nAoE: 750|nCooldown: 20 sec.|r|n|r")
