call LANG_A('MrW1',1,0,"The hero resurrects zombies at the specified point, which appear every 0.25 and attack all surrounding enemies.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDuration: 1 sec.|nZombie Damage: 15 + 0.3*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF.|nZombie AS: 1.3|nZombie MS: 350+|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF|nLife time: 5 sec.|nRange: 1200|nCooldown:"+" 7 sec.|r|n|nWhen used on yourself, if the hero has available stolen shadows, a special strong zombie will be created that will constantly run next to Moria and attack all enemies around him, otherwise the normal version is used.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nZombie Damage: 60 + 4*|c00FFFF66AllStat|r|cFF00A5FF of "+"selected shadow.|nZombie AS: 1.1|nZombie MS: 400+|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF of Moria.|nLife time: Unlimited (Until T is activated or the shadow is passed on to another)|nCooldown: 7 sec.|r|n|r")
