call LANG_A('A06Y',1,0,"Magu Magu no Mi:|nAkainu blocks damage if it is greater than a certain amount of his health. He recovers some of the damage over 7 sec.|n|n|cFF00A5FFBlock: 10%|nDamage Threshold: 3% of Max HP.|nRestoration: 10% of damage.|r|n|nVolcano Eruption:|nAkainu goes underground and moves to the specified poi"+"nt, after a while bursting out of the ground, pushing away affected enemies and stunning them. The time of appearance at the point depends on the distance. Also, when leaving, leaves a puddle of lava for 5 seconds, which deals 450 AoE 1% Max HP magic damage to all enemies on the ground every 0.2 sec"+". and slows MS by 60% for 3 sec.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 3*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 2 sec.|nMovement duration: from 1.5 to 4 sec.|nRange: 2500|nAoE: 400|nCast time: +0.2 sec.|nCooldown: 35 sec. after the teleport is complete.|r")
call LANG_A('A06Y',1,1,"Magu Magu no Mi:|nAkainu blocks damage if it is greater than a certain amount of his health. He recovers some of the damage over 7 sec.|n|n|cFF00A5FFBlock: 10%|nDamage Threshold: 3% of Max HP.|nRestoration: 11.25% of damage.|r|n|nVolcano Eruption:|nAkainu goes underground and moves to the specified "+"point, after a while bursting out of the ground, pushing away affected enemies and stunning them. The time of appearance at the point depends on the distance. Also, when leaving, leaves a puddle of lava for 5 seconds, which deals 450 AoE 1% Max HP magic damage to all enemies on the ground every 0.2 "+"sec. and slows MS by 60% for 3 sec.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 4*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 2 sec.|nMovement duration: from 1.5 to 4 sec.|nRange: 2500|nAoE: 400|nCast time: +0.2 sec.|nCooldown: 35 sec. after the teleport is complete.|r")
