call LANG_A('A08V',1,0,"Shana summons the god Alastor to the battlefield, who deals damage to all enemies but takes away 75% of Shana's current HP. Shana is invulnerable while it is active. If Shana has less than 30% Max HP when using the ability, she dies.|n|n|cFFFF0000Channeling|r |n• The damage from the ability is pur"+"e unblockable (deals damage through invulnerability and shields)|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 2*Max HP of Shana.|nPreparation time: 3.4.|nCooldown: 30 sec.|r|n|nDuring the duration, you can forcefully explode by pressing T2|n• The damage from the ability is magical|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 30% of Max HP Shana per"+" sec.|nCurrent HP loss: 30% per sec.")
