call LANG_A('ADG1',1,0,"Dante enters a stance to block the next damage. For the first 0.15 seconds, Dante is paused. If an enemy deals damage within 0.15 seconds, the damage is completely blocked and all contact abilities are stopped. The cooldown is reset to 3 seconds, increases the damage of your next Q or W by 10% (the "+"bonus stacks up to 50%) and if the enemy is close, they are stunned.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage reduction: 70%|nDuration: 0.5 second|nMinimum stun range: 300|nStun: 0.5 seconds|nCast time: +0.05 seconds|nCooldown: 12 seconds|r|r")
