call LANG_A('JNF1',1,0,"Passive: After level 25, if Jiren's health drops below 25% HP, he enters full power, increasing his |c00FFFF66AllStat|r by 20 for the rest of the round and gaining 30% CC resistance.|nAlso, the ability is replaced by Overheating Blast, which automatically activates and goes on cooldown for 10 second"+"s, and increases the cast range of Blazing Magnetron to 1000.|n|nJiren begins to meditate, surrounding himself with a shield and restoring MP every second. Meditation ends if the hero is damaged.|n|n|cFFFF0000Channeling|r|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage Block: 100%|nMP Regeneration: 4% per sec.|nDuration: up "+"to 5 sec.|nCooldown: 25 sec. after end.|r|n|r|r")
