call LANG_A('GSG1',1,0,"Passive: Hanten Jutsushiki:|n• 20% of damage taken or dealt is converted into Gojo's MP.|n|nActive: Mugen: Atsu, Shuchu|nGojo creates a barrier that reduces incoming damage and pushes all enemies away.|cFF00A5FF|nDamage taken: -50%|nAoE: 300|nOne-time consumption: 5% of Gojo's Max MP.|nConsumes: G"+"ojo's MP from 50% of damage taken|nDuration: while MP is more than 10% of MAX MP.|nThe barrier can be removed with Sapphire or abilities that remove positive statuses.|nCooldown: 10 seconds after deactivation.")
