call LANG_A('GST1',1,0,"Gojo starts to use a territory expansion within 1-2 sec, which opens up within another 1 sec.|n• After closing the territory, it cannot be entered or exited, and everyone except Gojo will be in a pause.|n• The ability can be interrupted during the first second, during the second second the size "+"is adjusted.|n• The more time has passed for adjustment, the larger the area, but the shorter the duration.|n• Gojo's damage during the pause: 100%|n• Gojo loses the ability to attack but gains A ability|cFF00A5FF|nOne-time consumption: 5% of Gojo's Max MP.|nConsumes: 4% of Gojo's Max MP per s"+"ec.|nAoE: 200-1600|nDuration: up to 12-(Adjustment time)*5 sec.|nCast time: +0.4 sec.|nCooldown: 60 after the end of the ability.|r")
