call LANG_A('GKQ1',1,0,"Goku focuses Ki energy in his hands and then releases it towards the enemy.|n• Using Ctrl+Q, you can select a variation of the ability.|nNormal versions:|n• Kamehameha - standard variation.|n• Super Kamehameha - Increases range, damage by 1*|c00FF5555STR|r and radius, at the cost of increased "+"preparation time and a 100% increase in MP cost.|nEnhanced versions of Super Kamehameha:|n• Kaioken Kamehameha - Increases damage by an additional 1*|c00FF5555STR|r at the cost of (2% Max HP * Number of Kaioken used per round), but no more than 10%. Only available in basic form.|n• Kaioken x10 K"+"amehameha - Increases damage by an additional 3*|c00FF5555STR|r at the cost of (4% Max HP * Number of Kaioken used per round), but no more than 20%. Only available in SSGSS.|n• Kamehameha x10 - Increases damage by an additional 1*|c00FF5555STR|r at the cost of 10% Max MP. Only available in SS4.|n|"+"n|cFF00A5FF|nBase Damage: 2*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF +75. / +1*|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nPreparation time: 0.8 / 2.3 sec.|nRange: 2000 / 3500|nAoE: 150(400) / 220(500)|nCast time: +0.3 sec.|nCooldown: 20 sec. (Super and Kamehameha x10: 27 sec., Kaioken: 30 sec.)|r")
