call LANG_A('GKW5',1,0,"Goku teleports to the target enemy, performing a combo of attacks, knocking the enemy back and jumping back.|n|nVariations:|n• Base - Standard form.|n• Soaring Fist - Goku additionally flies to the enemy and strikes, dealing an additional 3*|c00FF5555STR|r damage and stunning for an additional 2"+" seconds, at the cost of an additional 200 MP.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nBase Damage: 5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF +150.|nStun: 1 sec.|nRange: 800|nCast time: +0.2 sec.|nCooldown: 18 sec. (Soaring Fist: 20 sec.)|r")
