call LANG_A('GKT1',1,0,"Goku creates a dragon from Ki energy and attacks enemies with it.|n• Using Ctrl + T, you can select a variation of the ability:|n|nVariations:|n• Dragon Hammer - a flight along a line, causing damage to all enemies hit.|n• Dragon Fist Explosion - a target-oriented ability that stuns the enemy "+"and causes more damage.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 10*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF / 11*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0 / 2 sec.|nRange: 3000 / 900|nAoE: 350 / 0|nCast time: +0.2 sec.|nCooldown: 40 sec.|r")
call LANG_A('GKT1',2,0,"Dragon Fist, [|cffffcc00Level 1|r] (|cffffcc00T|r)")
call LANG_A('GKT1',3,0,"Goku creates a dragon from Ki energy and attacks enemies with it.|n• Using Ctrl + T, you can select a variation of the ability:|n|nVariations:|n• Dragon Hammer - a flight along a line, causing damage to all enemies hit.|n• Dragon Fist Explosion - a target-oriented ability that stuns the enemy "+"and causes more damage.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 10*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF / 11*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0 / 2 sec.|nRange: 3000 / 900|nAoE: 350 / 0|nCast time: +0.2 sec.|nCooldown: 40 sec.|r")
call LANG_A('GKT2',1,0,"A variation where Goku flies forward, dealing damage to all enemies he hits.|n|n|cFF00A5FFRange: 3000|nAoE: 350")
call LANG_A('GKT3',1,0,"A variation where Goku dashes towards the target, slamming the opponent into the ground and delivers an additional blow that summons a ki dragon that explodes onto the opponent.|n|n|cFF00A5FFAdditional damage: 1*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 2 sec.|nRange: 900")
