call LANG_A('GKR1',1,0,"Goku focuses on the target's energy and teleports to them. If the target is an enemy, deals damage and stuns the target|n• Preparation time depends on the range. Up to 1000 range, the movement is instant and the cost is reduced by 2 times. Every subsequent 1000 range increases the duration by 1 se"+"c, but no more than 7 seconds.|n• If Goku loses sight of the target for more than 1 second, Ability is automatically canceled.|n• Canceling the teleport reduces the cooldown to 5 sec. If the ability was interrupted by control effects, the cooldown is full.|n• Used during Super Kamehameha, perf"+"orms Warp Kamehameha, moving Goku behind the enemy's target to fire a ki shot instead of hitting it. If the target is an enemy, the shot hits them. If the target is an ally, the shot is fired away from the target.|n• The teleport duration is instant, but the range is limited to 2000 and consumes t"+"wice as much MP.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 2*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0.5 sec.|nMP Cost: 10%(20%) after performing a teleport.|nRange: Unlimited(2000)|nCooldown: 28 seconds after performing a teleport.|r")
call LANG_A('GKR1',1,1,"Goku focuses on the target's energy and teleports to them. If the target is an enemy, deals damage and stuns the target|n• Preparation time depends on the range. Up to 1000 range, the movement is instant and the cost is reduced by 2 times. Every subsequent 1000 range increases the duration by 1 se"+"c, but no more than 7 seconds.|n• If Goku loses sight of the target for more than 1 second, Ability is automatically canceled.|n• Canceling the teleport reduces the cooldown to 5 sec. If the ability was interrupted by control effects, the cooldown is full.|n• Used during Super Kamehameha, perf"+"orms Warp Kamehameha, moving Goku behind the enemy's target to fire a ki shot instead of hitting it. If the target is an enemy, the shot hits them. If the target is an ally, the shot is fired away from the target.|n• The teleport duration is instant, but the range is limited to 2000 and consumes t"+"wice as much MP.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 2.5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0.5 sec.|nMP Cost: 10%(20%) after performing a teleport.|nRange: Unlimited(2000)|nCooldown: 25 seconds after performing a teleport.|r")
call LANG_A('GKR1',1,2,"Goku focuses on the target's energy and teleports to them. If the target is an enemy, deals damage and stuns the target|n• Preparation time depends on the range. Up to 1000 range, the movement is instant and the cost is reduced by 2 times. Every subsequent 1000 range increases the duration by 1 se"+"c, but no more than 7 seconds.|n• If Goku loses sight of the target for more than 1 second, Ability is automatically canceled.|n• Canceling the teleport reduces the cooldown to 5 sec. If the ability was interrupted by control effects, the cooldown is full.|n• Used during Super Kamehameha, perf"+"orms Warp Kamehameha, moving Goku behind the enemy's target to fire a ki shot instead of hitting it. If the target is an enemy, the shot hits them. If the target is an ally, the shot is fired away from the target.|n• The teleport duration is instant, but the range is limited to 2000 and consumes t"+"wice as much MP.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 3*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0.5 sec.|nMP Cost: 10%(20%) after performing a teleport.|nRange: Unlimited(2000)|nCooldown: 22 seconds after performing a teleport.|r")
call LANG_A('GKR1',1,3,"Goku focuses on the target's energy and teleports to them. If the target is an enemy, deals damage and stuns the target|n• Preparation time depends on the range. Up to 1000 range, the movement is instant and the cost is reduced by 2 times. Every subsequent 1000 range increases the duration by 1 se"+"c, but no more than 7 seconds.|n• If Goku loses sight of the target for more than 1 second, Ability is automatically canceled.|n• Canceling the teleport reduces the cooldown to 5 sec. If the ability was interrupted by control effects, the cooldown is full.|n• Used during Super Kamehameha, perf"+"orms Warp Kamehameha, moving Goku behind the enemy's target to fire a ki shot instead of hitting it. If the target is an enemy, the shot hits them. If the target is an ally, the shot is fired away from the target.|n• The teleport duration is instant, but the range is limited to 2000 and consumes t"+"wice as much MP.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 3.5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0.5 sec.|nMP Cost: 10%(20%) after performing a teleport.|nRange: Unlimited(2000)|nCooldown: 19 seconds after performing a teleport.|r")
call LANG_A('GKR1',1,4,"Goku focuses on the target's energy and teleports to them. If the target is an enemy, deals damage and stuns the target|n• Preparation time depends on the range. Up to 1000 range, the movement is instant and the cost is reduced by 2 times. Every subsequent 1000 range increases the duration by 1 se"+"c, but no more than 7 seconds.|n• If Goku loses sight of the target for more than 1 second, Ability is automatically canceled.|n• Canceling the teleport reduces the cooldown to 5 sec. If the ability was interrupted by control effects, the cooldown is full.|n• Used during Super Kamehameha, perf"+"orms Warp Kamehameha, moving Goku behind the enemy's target to fire a ki shot instead of hitting it. If the target is an enemy, the shot hits them. If the target is an ally, the shot is fired away from the target.|n• The teleport duration is instant, but the range is limited to 2000 and consumes t"+"wice as much MP.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 4*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0.5 sec.|nMP Cost: 10%(20%) after performing a teleport.|nRange: Unlimited(2000)|nCooldown: 16 seconds after performing a teleport.|r")
call LANG_A('GKR1',2,0,"Instant Transmission, [|cffffcc00Level %d|r] (|cffffcc00R|r)")
call LANG_A('GKR1',3,0,"Goku focuses on the target's energy and teleports to them. If the target is an enemy, deals damage and stuns the target|n• Preparation time depends on the range. Up to 1000 range, the movement is instant and the cost is reduced by 2 times. Every subsequent 1000 range increases the duration by 1 se"+"c, but no more than 7 seconds.|n• If Goku loses sight of the target for more than 1 second, Ability is automatically canceled.|n• Canceling the teleport reduces the cooldown to 5 sec. If the ability was interrupted by control effects, the cooldown is full.|n• Used during Super Kamehameha, perf"+"orms Warp Kamehameha, moving Goku behind the enemy's target to fire a ki shot instead of hitting it. If the target is an enemy, the shot hits them. If the target is an ally, the shot is fired away from the target.|n• The teleport duration is instant, but the range is limited to 2000 and consumes t"+"wice as much MP.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 2/2.5/3/3.5/4*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 0.5 sec.|nMP Cost: 10%(20%) after performing a teleport.|nRange: Unlimited(2000)|nCooldown: 28/25/22/19/16 seconds after performing a teleport.|r")
