call LANG_A('GKE1',2,0,"Ki Mastery, [|cffffcc00Level %d|r] (|cffffcc00E|r)")
call LANG_A('GKE1',3,0,"Goku has a variety of techniques that he uses in situations that suit him. You can change the ability with Ctrl+E.|nAbilities:|n• Solar Flare - Blinds and slows down enemies around him.|n|cFF00A5FFAoE: 800|nMS/AS Reduction: 85%|nDuration: 2\\2.5\\3\\3.5\\4 sec.|nCooldown: 28 sec.|r|n• Kiai - Pus"+"hes back and stuns enemies around Goku.|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 1\\1.5\\2\\2.5\\3*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 1 sec.|nAoE: 450|nCooldown: 25\\24\\23\\22\\21 sec.|r|n• Zanzoken - Inaccessibility and dodges that last until Goku is CC'd or paused.|n|cFF00A5FFDuration: 1 sec.|nCooldown: 14\\13\\12\\"+"11\\10 seconds after the end.|r|n• Ki Blast - A ball with a small cooldown, begins to fly after the nearest enemy when near them.|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 3\\3.5\\4\\4.5\\5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nRange: 1600|nDetection radius: 500|nAoE: 150 (250)|nCooldown: 14\\13\\12\\11\\10 sec.|r|n• Continuou"+"s Energy Bullets - Several shots forward, each hit reduces damage by 10% to the enemy hit.|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 0.5\\0.75\\1\\1.25\\1.5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF+10\\20\\30\\40\\50 (Per shot)|nStun: 0.15 sec|nNumber of shots: 5|nRange: 1400|nAoE: 150|nCooldown: 28\\26\\24\\22\\20 sec.|r")
