call LANG_A('GKE6',1,0,"Goku fires multiple shots in a given direction, each hit reducing the damage of subsequent projectiles by 10%.|nAutomatic E switching is enabled by default, toggle it with the -AutoE command.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 0.5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF+10 (Per shot)|nStun: 0.15 sec.|nNumber of shots: 5|nR"+"ange: 1400|nAoE: 150|nCooldown: 28 sec.|r")
