call LANG_A('GKG1',1,0,"Goku begins to slowly form a ball of life energy from the surrounding world, which will be thrown at the enemy.|nThe more energy is filled, the larger the ball and the more damage it deals.|nEnemies will be under the effect of Heavy Stun.|nAllies can spend 10% of Max MP to increase the size of the b"+"all by 0.05 * (MP sent).|nIf Goku is subjected to any form of silence, stun or pause, the ability will end, starting a 15 sec cooldown.|nAt the beginning of the round, it is always on cooldown for (35-Hero Level) sec.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 200+((0.1*Hero level)+(0.1*Ball size))*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cF"+"F00A5FF + (0.02*Ball size)*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF every 0.2 sec. for 1 sec.|nMaximum size: 30+2*Hero level|nMinimum size for throw: 10|nMinimum size for Super Spirit Bomb: 25|nRange: 3000 // 6000|nAoE: 0 // 700 → 1200|nCooldown: 40 seconds after the end of the ability.|r|r")
call LANG_A('GKG1',2,0,"Spirit Bomb, [|cffffcc00Level %d|r] (|cffffcc00G|r)")
call LANG_A('GKG1',3,0,"Goku begins to slowly form a ball of life energy from the surrounding world, which will be thrown at the enemy.|nThe more energy is filled, the larger the ball and the more damage it deals.|nEnemies will be under the effect of Heavy Stun.|nAllies can spend 10% of Max MP to increase the size of the b"+"all by 0.05 * (MP sent).|nIf Goku is subjected to any form of silence, stun or pause, the ability will end, starting a 15 sec cooldown.|nAt the beginning of the round, it is always on cooldown for (35-Hero Level) sec.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 200+((0.1*Hero level)+(0.1*Ball size))*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cF"+"F00A5FF + (0.02*Ball size)*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF every 0.2 sec. for 1 sec.|nMaximum size: 30+2*Hero level|nMinimum size for throw: 10|nMinimum size for Super Spirit Bomb: 25|nRange: 3000 // 6000|nAoE: 0 // 700 → 1200|nCooldown: 40 seconds after the end of the ability.|r|r")
call LANG_A('GKG2',1,0,"Your hero sends 10% of his Max MP to allied Goku, empowering his Spirit Bomb. Can be sent once per ability duration.")
call LANG_A('GKG3',1,0,"Cancels Spirit Bomb.|n|n|cFF00A5FFCooldown: 15 sec.|r")
call LANG_A('GKG4',1,0,"Goku gathers the collected energy into a small ball and throws it at the target enemy, applying heavy stun for 1 second and throwing it into the air, exploding at the end.|n|n|cFF00A5FFExplosion Damage: 200+(0.1*Ball size)*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF |nPeriodic damage: (0.02*Ball size)*|r|c00FF5555S"+"TR|r|cFF00A5FF every 0.2 sec. for 1 sec.|nRange: 3000|nCooldown: 40 sec.|r|r")
