call LANG_A('GKG7',1,0,"Goku enters a stance, activating Ultra Instinct's abilities to block the next damage and, if the enemy is nearby, to perform a counterattack. Activating in any form does not consume an dodge charge, but goes to the counter to gain MUI. Minimum damage is 200.|nIf the enemy deals damage in less than 0"+".1 sec, Cooldown is reset to 3 sec. Cannot be activated more than 3 times in a row. Resets 10 seconds after the last successful dodge.|n|nPassive: When Goku receives less than (100+40% from missing HP) damage, Goku blocks it and dodges any damage for 0.15 sec, spending an dodge charge and MP equal t"+"o 20% of damage. Lasts as long as there are dodge charges.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 1 sec.|nMinimum range for counterattack: 500|nDuration: 2 sec.|nDoom duration on unsuccessful counterattack: 0.5 sec.|nCast time: +0.15 sec.|nCooldown: 15 seconds.|r|r")
