call LANG_A('ASGG',1,0,"Gaara uses an ability based on the last one used.|n• Q - lifts the target and crushes it in the process|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 3*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 2 sec|nDuration: 1 sec.|r|n• W - sucks in everyone at the point of application|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 6*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF (0.6 x 1"+"0 times)|nAoE: 550|nDuration: 4 sec.|r|n• R - presses everyone within the sand radius for 2 sec|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 5*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF|nAoE: 800|r|n• T - creates Karura on Gaara, blocking incoming damage within a radius of 500 to allies for 5 seconds.|cFF00A5FF|nCooldown: 10 sec.")
