call LANG_A('GKMI',1,0,"Increase |c00FFFF66AllStat|r by 32 and increases magical damage by an additional 10%. Changes Goku's W and G. Also gives a limit of 15 dodges, which are replenished every second.|nIf MUI runs out due to loss of MP or HP - Goku gets Heavy Stun for 1 sec and Silence for 4 sec, MS/AS is also slowed by "+"50% for 7 sec, and both UIs go into Cooldown for 75 sec.|nIf it runs out due to time or manual termination, Goku returns to UI.|n|n|cFF00A5FFMP Consumption: 3% per sec.|nDuration: 20 sec.|nCooldown: 25 sec. after finishing.|r")
