call LANG_A('GKF1',1,0,"Transformation into the specified form. Transformation is free from intermediate forms. Transition to divine forms prohibits transition to intermediate and SS4 without returning to the base.|nIf MP is not enough to maintain, or HP is less than 15%, then a transition to the base form will occur.|n|nI"+"ntermediate forms:|n|cffffcc00Super Saiyan - available from level 8|r|n|cffffcc00Super Saiyan 2 - available from level 14.|r|n|cffffcc00Super Saiyan 3 - available from level 14.|r|nDivine forms:|n|c00FF4242Super Saiyan God - available from level 20. |r|n|cFF00A5FFSuper Saiyan God Super Saiyan - avai"+"lable from level 23.|r|nFinal forms:|n|cFFFF0000Super Saiyan 4 - available from level 20.|r|n|c00C7C7D6Ultra Instinct - available if, after reaching level 26, Goku takes damage per round equal to 2*Max HP|r|n|c00F1F1F5Mastered Ultra Instinct - available from level 35, if Goku has already obtained Ul"+"tra Instinct and can dodge 15 times per round.|r")
