call LANG_A('A0RI',1,0,"Vegito focuses on the target's energy and teleports to them. If the target is an enemy, deals damage and stuns the target|n• Cast time depends on distance. Up to 1000 range, movement is instant and cost is halved. Every subsequent 1000 range increases the duration by 1 sec, but no more than 7 seco"+"nds.|n• If Vegito loses sight of the target for more than 1 second, Ability is automatically canceled.|n• Canceling the teleport reduces the cooldown to 5 sec. If the ability was interrupted by control effects, the cooldown is full.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: (0.5+Hero Level*0.1)*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|c"+"FF00A5FF|nStun: 0.75 sec.|nMP Cost: 10% after teleporting.|nRange: Unlimited|nCooldown: 20 seconds after teleporting.|r")
