call LANG_A('A1AP',1,0,"Doflamingo creates a cage that pulls all enemies to its center for 5 seconds. If opponents resist this, they take damage.|nIf you jump from a cage at a range greater than 200, but less than 800, the target will receive colossal damage, ignoring everything. If you teleport to a distance further than "+"800, the target will not receive damage.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 3*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF per second / 25% Max HP of target.|nAoE: 2000|nCast time: +0.4 sec.|nCooldown: 40 sec.|r")
