call LANG_A('A1B5',1,0,"Tamamo creates a temple. Enemies caught in its area of effect will lose mana when the cast ends, and will lose health if they leave the temple. While the temple is cast, Tamamo deals great damage inside the seals. The temple also regenerates health and mana to all allies (including Tamamo) inside it"+".|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 4*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF per sec (2 sec).|nAoE: 1000(2000)|nRegeneration: 1% Max HP\\MP|nHP\\MP loss: 2%\\2% of the current value.|nTemple duration: 20 sec.|nCast time: +0.5 sec.|nCooldown: 70 sec.")
