call LANG_A('A1B6',1,0,"Tamamo turns into a \"Cat\" and starts indiscriminately attacking all opponents inside the temple, acts while the temple is standing. At the end of the ability, Tamamo is stunned for 2 seconds and recovers 15% of health. All characters inside the temple lose the ability to cast spells and use items,"+" and are also greatly slowed down. The ability can damage (or even kill) your allies.|nAvailable 3 seconds after activating the temple. Not available in Emiya Shirou's UBW.|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 4*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF per second.")
