call LANG_A('SaE1',1,0,"Passive:|cFF00A5FF|nEach damage dealt by abilities applies a debuff for 30 seconds. Stacks up to 5 times.|n• Target's Max HP cannot exceed 95/90/85/80/75%|n• AS/MS: - 10/20/30/40/50%|n• Each overlay updates the time.|n• Can be removed with a Breaker.|r|n|nActive:|cFF00A5FF|nReduces damage ta"+"ken by 50% for 4 sec.|nAS/MS: + 10%|nActivation removes 10% of current MP|n• If there is 100% block in zone F|n• When W is active, the blocking damage is replaced by reverse, dealing 1*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF within a 500 radius.|nCooldown: 20 sec|r")
