call LANG_A('SaG1',1,0,"G(passive) - when swordsmen die, their sword drops until the end of the round|nWhen picking up a sword, the damage to Sabrak's hand increases by 3. If Sabrak kills the Hero by himself, there is no need to pick up the sword.|nG(Instant) - Sabrak explodes his zone|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 8*|r|c00FF5555STR|"+"r|cFF00A5FF+|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF*0.1 per sword pure damage blocked.|n• Sabrak reduces his Max HP and MP by 30% of the maximum for 30 seconds.|n|nCooldown: 80 seconds")
