call LANG_A('SaT1',3,0,"T:|nSabrak creates a clone with 100% damage dealt and received, and he goes into invisibility.|nWhen the original uses abilities, or at a distance of more than 2500 from the original, the invisibility is reset and the clone disappears.|nThe use of the clone's abilities is taken into the cooldown of "+"the original's abilities.|n• Clone life 15 seconds;|n• The death of a clone (T2 is also used in the killer) or the use of T2 stops the ability.|nT2:|nSabrak strikes from behind.|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 5*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|nIn zone F|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 6*|r|c00FF5555STR|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: 2 sec|nCoo"+"ldown: 40")
