call LANG_A('KHG1',1,0,"Q: Creates 3 hedgehogs, one main one, whose damage is 20% higher and two additional ones on the sides, whose damage is equal to 20% of the original, and the push force is equal to 30%|n|nW: Increases attack range to 600. Teleports to the enemy during basic attacks. AS: +20% for 5 seconds|n|nE: When "+"finished, stuns for an additional 1 second.")
