call LANG_A('KHG2',1,0,"Q: Creates 2 hedgehogs, each of which separately deals 60% damage. They live for 5 seconds and slow down AS by 30% and MS by 50%. Hedgehogs don't push.|n|nW: When hit, reduces Def by 2/4/6/8/10 per level W (at level 35 by 20) and AS by 30% for 5 seconds, and also stuns for 1.5 seconds.|n|nE: Once ev"+"ery 1 second, Hibari teleports and strikes, dealing 25/50/75/100/125% damage per strike depending on E level")
