call LANG_A('KkR1',1,0,"Kurapika throws a chain at the target enemy with an option to throw after.|n• Reduces outgoing damage from the target by 40%|n• At a distance of more than 1200, the chain breaks.|n• At a distance greater than 300, attracts|nOnce hit, gives the ability to throw up to 1200 at a specified point.|"+"n|n• From level 5 can be used on allies:|cff2b95ff|n- reduces incoming damage by 40%|n- increases outgoing damage by 20%|n- 75% of the restored health from W goes to an ally|n|nDamage: 1* Selected Attribute|nThrow Damage: 5* Selected Attribute|nRange: 1000|nPreparation: 0.2 sec|nDuration: 2 sec|nC"+"ooldown: 25 sec")
