call LANG_A('HerF',1,0,"Passive:|nAll characters with the Swordsman stat receive 15% more damage from hero abilities.|nAbilities deal 15% more damage to heroes with Artoria Pendragon's face.|nHeroine X quests:|nAfter killing Swordsman heroes, the following abilities are strengthened:|n2/4/6/8/9/10/12 Q/W/E/F/G/R/T kills |n"+"(Heroes with Artoria Pendragon's face count as 2 kills)|n|nActive:|n• 8 kills:|cFF00A5FF Stun: +1 sec.|r|nWhen activated, if the target of Heroine X's previous abilities was a Swordsman hero and they are within 1500 range, she will attack that target. The target is chosen randomly if the Ability w"+"as R or G and multiple Swordsman heroes were affected by them.|cFF00A5FF |nDamage: 3*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF.|nCooldown: 8 sec.|r")
