call LANG_A('MaE1',1,0,"Kyuubey attempts to make a contract with said target. If the character is a female ally, he gains |c00FFFF66AllStat|r but loses 1.5% HP per second in return. The target gains 25% total lifesteal from the damage. (Min damage - 50)|nCan be activated on a female enemy whose HP is below 30%.|nIf the tar"+"get dies, a cataclysm occurs that deals HP damage to everyone within 600 AoE.|nIf the target is male, they are blinded for 6 seconds and silenced for 3 seconds, however, the cooldown time is reduced to 20 sec.|n|cFF00A5FF|nBonus Stats: 20|nDuration: 15 sec.|nDamage: 100% target's Max HP|nRange: 1500"+"|nCooldown: 40 sec|r")
