call LANG_A('MadD',1,0,"• |c0000FFFFPurification of the Soul Gem|r: Each death of an enemy or ally restores 10% of Madoka's MP and grants one stack of stat-boosting Soul Gem for the rest of the round.|n|cFF00A5FFStatistics: +5 |r|c00FFFF66AllStat|r|cFF00A5FF per stack.|r|n|n|nMadoka spends a charge of a Soul Gem to empow"+"er her next ability.|n|cFF00A5FFMagic Arrow: +35% damage per stack|nStorm of Arrows: +25% damage per stack.|nCooldown: 2 seconds|r")
call LANG_A('MadF',1,0,"After Madoka's death, one of the following scenarios occurs:|n• |c00D70000Broken Contract|r - a cataclysm occurs, dealing damage to everyone around Madoka in a 1300 radius - 125% of her HP.|nCondition: None of the conditions were met.|n• |c0000FFFFPassive regeneration|r of all allies until the e"+"nd of the round - 1% of Madoka's Max HP per sec. If there are no allies left, the first scenario is triggered.|nCondition: During the round, 2000+50 * Round HP was restored to allied main heroes.|n• |c001AFF53Resurrects|r one random ally with 50% HP / MP if there is one, if not - the second scenar"+"io occurs.|nCondition: During the round, 4000+100 * Round HP was restored to allied main heroes.|n• |c00FFFC01Madoka is reborn as a Goddess|r. Receives a boost to some abilities.|nCondition: During the round, 4000+100*Round HP was restored to allied main heroes and 4000+100*Round damage was inflic"+"ted on enemies.|nDoes not work in duels. In FFA, the requirements for health restoration change from allies to Madoka herself.")
