call LANG_A('OM13',1,0,"Orochimaru aims at the enemy and bites on the neck, leaving a seal. Seal owners lose MP, HP when using abilities. If the target of the seal is Sasuke or Kimimaru, they gain 20 stats and are not affected by MP and HP loss.|nPassive: Upon death, Orochimaru transforms into a snake that lives for 30 sec"+"onds.|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 3*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF. (1*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF to ally)|nRange: 1100|nStun: 1 sec|nSeal Damage and Mana Break: 2.5% (1.5 times higher for 15 seconds after possessing)|nCooldown: 27 seconds|r")
call LANG_A('OM14',1,0,"Using the mask of the god of death, Orochimaru uses it to seal an enemy within himself, dealing damage based on his health.|n|c00FF0000|nWhen used, Orochimaru is guaranteed to die.|r|n|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 30% of your Max HP per second. (Blocked by magic defense and resist)|nSelf Damage: 30% of Max "+"HP per second.|nRange: 700|nCooldown: 40 seconds|r")
call LANG_A('OM15',1,0,"Orochimaru possesses a target that deals damage equal to 15% of their Max HP.|nIf the target's HP drops to 10%, they die and Orochimaru is reborn as Yamata No Orochi.|nIf Yamata No Orochi survives for 20 seconds, Orochimaru is resurrected.")
