call LANG_A('RenD',1,0,"Each time Rengoku uses an ability, he fills his lungs with air to empower his next ability. If Rengoku does not use an ability for 15 seconds, the next ability is enhanced and restores Rengoku's HP (except T). If an ability is used, the timer is reset.|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 15%.|nRecovery: 6% HP.|r|n|n"+" • |c0000FF00Growing Fire|r: Each QWE ability used changes the effect of the next ability for 10 seconds.")
