call LANG_A('KaA1',1,0,"Karna fires a laser from her eye that deals damage, stuns, and slows, and after 1 sec, causes an explosive chain that stuns again.|nCost increases depending on level.|n|n|cFF00A5FF Damage: (0.75+(Hero Level*0.05))*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF + (1+(Hero Level*0.1))*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF|nStun: "+"1+1 sec.|nAS/MS Slow: 50% for 3 sec.|nRange: 2500|nAoe: 125(200)|nMP Cost: 50+5 MP per level.|nCast Time: +0.1 sec.|nCooldown: 20 sec.|r")
call LANG_A('KaA2',1,0,"• |c0000FFFFKavacha and Kundala|r: Karna does not take 60% damage at once, but gradually over several seconds.|n|n|cFF00A5FFDuration: 3 seconds.|nMinimum damage: 200 units.|nAvailable from level 12.|r|n|n• |c0000FFFFFilling|r: Each use of abilities gives one charge of this ability for 5 seconds."+"|nFrom level 12, receiving a charge increases the next basic attack by 2x|c003CFF3CAGI|r as magic damage.|nWhen activated, Karna spends one charge and receives a shield for one second, accelerates and deals damage around himself. If Karna has dropped armor, he does not receive a shield.|n|n|cFF00A5F"+"FDamage: 2*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF|nCooldown: 6 sec.|r")
