call LANG_A('KaAB',1,0,"Karna uses his strongest weapon - burning the enemies around him. After preparation, Karna launches a volley of Vasavi Shakti at the specified area, causing colossal damage and reducing the regeneration of enemies by 50% for 30 sec.|nUsing the ability disables Armor F for 20 seconds.|n|n|cFF00A5FFDa"+"mage(AOE): 2*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF per second|nDamage (main): 14*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF|nDuration: 7 sec|nRange: Entire map|nAoE: 800|nCooldown: 60 seconds.")
