call LANG_A('KaAG',1,0,"Vasavi Shakti is ready. There are two types of use available.|n|n• Abide to Death: By pressing himself, Karna releases a volley that destroys everything around him.|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 14*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF (total)|nRange: 3000|nAoE: 325|r|n|n• Sunlight Treasure: By clicking on the point"+", Karna fires a destructive beam in the indicated direction.|n|cFF00A5FFDamage: 14*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF (total)|nAoE: 1000|n|nCooldown: 60 seconds")
