call LANG_A('A2DC',1,0,"Gives 7 ammo at the start of the level. Used for R and T Sinon, health restoration from them is 60% effective. The last ammo is always overcharged.|nCritical damage can work simultaneously from different sources, but no more than 2, and one of the items has a double chance of crit.|nDouble chance pr"+"iority: Yamato -> Fully assembled jump swords -> Tempered Sword -> All other modifiers.|n|nPressing it reloads the clip, adding +3 ammo and speeding up Sinon.|n|n • |c00007cceSniper Backstab:|r Hitting in the back deals additional damage.|n|n|cFF00A5FFSupercharge: +20% of enemy's missing HP.|nHast"+"e: 35% for 5 sec.|nBackstab: +15%|nCooldown: 25 seconds|r")
