call LANG_A('AST1',3,0,"Aizen uses his Zanpakutō's ability to create an illusion of himself.|n• After the ability, Aizen's mana becomes half of the illusion.|n• Adds T2 ability.|n• The illusion has all the abilities of the original with common cooldowns but 80% damage.|nWhen receiving damage over 4000 or death, a qu"+"ick version of the T2 attack is performed with the original and damage 55% of the initial one.|n• When Hougioku awakens, +2000 damage received by illusion.|n|cFF00A5FF|nDamage: 9*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A5FF|nDuration: 10 seconds.|nCooldown: 40 sec from the end of ability.|r|r")
