call LANG_A('AKF1',1,0,"Passive:|n• Kimimaro's HP regeneration: -20|n• From level 12 HP regeneration increases by 0.25*|r|c00FF5555STR|r per sec, and also 40% reduction of damage from physical attacks and abilities.|nActive:|nOver 0.5 sec Kimimaro activates the cursed seal, sacrificing part of his chakra and receiving "+"natural chakra in return, which strengthens his combat stats.|n• The -20 HP regeneration of Kimimaro also stops applying.|n• Consumes 30% of current mana once per use|n|cFF00A5FF|nHP: +1500|nMP: +2000|nAD: +100|nDef: +10|nAttack delay: 1.1|nDuration: 20 sec.|nCooldown: 20 sec. after the mark is "+"turned off")
