call LANG_A('AKG1',1,0,"Passive: |n• Kimimaro consumes 10% of current HP for each ability, increasing its damage by 35% of that value (Q: by 17.5% in total over all projectiles, W: by 8.75% per second of spinning). |n|nActive:|nKimimaro performs a series of strikes in a direction, dealing damage and stunning enemies.|n|c"+"FF00A5FF|nDamage: 200+5*|r|c003CFF3CAGI|r|cFF00A5FF per 10 strikes|nStun: 1 sec|nAoE: 200|nDuration: 2 sec.|nCooldown: 25 sec.")
