call LANG_A('BbGb',1,0,"|c00FFFC01Passive — decay:|r|n• Every attack and every ability hit applies decay: (0.25+0.05*Hero Level)*|c0077FFFFINT|r damage in parts over 3 sec.|n• Decays stack: each hit has its own, they run at the same time and do not extend each other.|n• Aging: while decay is active on an enemy, tha"+"t enemy deals 15% less damage.|n• Enemies near Baraggan are slowed (movement and attack), the closer the stronger.|n|n|c00FFFC01Active — Respira Shroud:|r|n• For 8 sec., decay deals double damage and incoming damage is halved.|n|cFF00A5FF|nDecay: (0.25+0.05*Hero Level)*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A"+"5FF over 3 sec, doubled under the shroud|nEnemy damage reduction under decay: 15%|nNearby slow (movement and attack): from 7% (1200) to 28% (600)|nDamage reduction: 50%|nDuration: 8 sec|nCooldown: 55 sec.|r")
call LANG_A('BbGb',3,0,"|c00FFFC01Passive — decay:|r|n• Every attack and every ability hit applies decay: (0.25+0.05*Hero Level)*|c0077FFFFINT|r damage in parts over 3 sec.|n• Decays stack: each hit has its own, they run at the same time and do not extend each other.|n• Aging: while decay is active on an enemy, tha"+"t enemy deals 15% less damage.|n• Enemies near Baraggan are slowed (movement and attack), the closer the stronger.|n|n|c00FFFC01Active — Respira Shroud:|r|n• For 8 sec., decay deals double damage and incoming damage is halved.|n|cFF00A5FF|nDecay: (0.25+0.05*Hero Level)*|r|c0077FFFFINT|r|cFF00A"+"5FF over 3 sec, doubled under the shroud|nEnemy damage reduction under decay: 15%|nNearby slow (movement and attack): from 7% (1200) to 28% (600)|nDamage reduction: 50%|nDuration: 8 sec|nCooldown: 55 sec.|r")
