call LANG_A('FlT1',1,0,"A Flandre clone at a point for 12 sec.: attacks nearby enemies on its own, attack damage — 50% of Flandre's |c0077FFFFINT|r.|n3 charges, no cooldown: three clones can be placed in a row; a charge restores itself every 20 sec.|nRight-click near a clone (up to 1600) — a damaging dash to it, once p"+"er clone.|nAttack order (A + click on an enemy or the ground) — all clones rush there, hit and stun (once per 30 sec.).|n|nPassive: every attack of Flandre and her clones deals an additional 0.19*|c0077FFFFINT|r.|n|n|cFF00A5FFRange: 800|r")
