call LANG_U('HHSN',3,"Hashirama Senju is a member of the famed Senju clan. Founded Konoha with members of his clan and childhood friend and rival Madara Uchiha and the Uchiha clan.|n|nRole: Caster, Disabler, Support, Durable|n|n")
call LANG_U('HHSG',3,"Madara Uchiha, one of the founders of the Leaf Village, left his village to implement the \"Eye of the Moon\" plan.|n|nRole: Caster, Disabler, Support, Durable|n|n")
call LANG_U('HDSN',3,"Danzō Shimura was the elder of the Hidden Leaf. As the founder and leader of the Root, Danzō earned notoriety as the Darkness of the Shinobi.|n|nRole: Caster, Disabler, Support|n|n")
